        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>文明驾驶与急救伤员题目笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script defer src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  html,\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    min-height: 100%;\n    background: #f4f4f2;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #333;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 764px;\n    padding: 38px 56px 48px 76px;\n    background: #fff;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .entry {\n    position: relative;\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.42;\n  }\n\n  .heading {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .number {\n    flex: 0 0 26px;\n    color: #b04a4a;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .title {\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .detail {\n    margin-left: 26px;\n  }\n\n  .detail.indented {\n    margin-left: 99px;\n  }\n\n  .keyword {\n    color: #d28080;\n  }\n\n  .mark-correct {\n    color: #a45151;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .mark-wrong {\n    color: #c77575;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .care-list {\n    margin: 3px 0 0 26px;\n    padding: 0;\n    list-style: none;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.42;\n  }\n\n  .care-list li {\n    margin: 0;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .label {\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .faint-stamp {\n    position: absolute;\n    color: rgba(190, 111, 99, 0.12);\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", serif;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    transform: rotate(-37deg);\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n\n  .stamp-one {\n    top: 284px;\n    left: 367px;\n  }\n\n  .stamp-two {\n    top: 360px;\n    left: 363px;\n  }\n\n  .bottom-watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 33px;\n    bottom: 18px;\n    width: 132px;\n    height: 36px;\n    color: rgba(130, 130, 130, 0.09);\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    text-align: right;\n  }\n\n  .bottom-watermark::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    display: block;\n    width: 38px;\n    height: 15px;\n    margin: 0 0 2px auto;\n    border: 2px solid rgba(130, 130, 130, 0.07);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 540px) {\n    body {\n      justify-content: flex-start;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      min-width: 540px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <section class=\"entry\">\n    <div class=\"heading\">\n      <span class=\"number\">52:</span>\n      <span class=\"title\">【文明驾驶题】</span>\n      <span>题目中有“<span class=\"keyword\">依次</span>”，答对。选择题:选项中有依次，直接选。</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry\">\n    <div class=\"heading\">\n      <span class=\"number\">53:</span>\n      <span class=\"title\">【文明驾驶题】</span>\n      <span>“减速” 跟 “确认安全” ／ “应当” <span class=\"mark-correct\">√</span>，应当书两年<span class=\"mark-wrong\">×</span></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"detail\">判断题:题目中有确认安全，答对。选择题:选项中一个确认安全直接选，两个确认</div>\n    <div class=\"detail\">安全选带减速或低速的。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry\">\n    <div class=\"heading\">\n      <span class=\"number\">54:</span>\n      <span class=\"title\">【文明驾驶题】</span>\n      <span>判断题：凡是见到判断题里有“ “（双引号）的就答<span class=\"mark-correct\">√</span></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"detail indented\">判断题:题目中有“<span class=\"keyword\">礼让</span>”，答对。选择题:选项中有礼让，直接选。</div>\n    <div class=\"detail indented\">判断题:题目中有“<span class=\"keyword\">避免</span>”，答对。不避让，答错。</div>\n    <div class=\"detail indented\">判断题:题目中有“<span class=\"keyword\">主动</span>”，答对。选择题:选项中有主动，直接选。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry\">\n    <div class=\"heading\">\n      <span class=\"number\">55:</span>\n      <span class=\"title\">【文明驾驶题】</span>\n      <span class=\"keyword\">关键词:减速、靠右依次</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"detail\">判断题:题目中有减速、靠右或靠右、减速，答对。</div>\n    <div class=\"detail\">选择题:选项中有减速、靠右或靠右、减速，直接选。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry\">\n    <div class=\"heading\">\n      <span class=\"number\">56:</span>\n      <span class=\"title\">【文明驾驶题】</span>\n      <span class=\"keyword\">关键词:减速、停车</span>\n      <span>　选择题:选项中减速、停车，直接选。</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry\">\n    <div class=\"heading\">\n      <span class=\"number\">57:</span>\n      <span class=\"title\">【文明驾驶题】</span>\n      <span class=\"keyword\">关键词:安全距离</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"detail\">选择题:选项中有一个安全距离直接选，两个安全距离选带大学的。</div>\n    <div class=\"detail\"><span class=\"keyword\">关键词:加速</span>　判断题:题目中有加速，答错（加速过去除外）</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry\">\n    <div class=\"heading\">\n      <span class=\"number\">58:</span>\n      <span class=\"title\">【违法行为】</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"detail\">判断题：<span class=\"keyword\">违法行为</span>，答<span class=\"mark-correct\">√</span>;没有违法答<span class=\"mark-wrong\">×</span>违章行为，答<span class=\"mark-wrong\">×</span></div>\n    <div class=\"detail\">选择题:题目中问属于什么行为?直接违法行为。</div>\n    <div class=\"detail indented\">问“几种违法行为”选“二种违法行为”</div>\n    <div class=\"detail\"><span class=\"keyword\">关键词</span>:可可选不、可可直接非、未来未选其他。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry\">\n    <div class=\"heading\">\n      <span class=\"number\">59:</span>\n      <span class=\"title\">【新能源/电动】</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"detail\">题中电、电动车答<span class=\"mark-correct\">√</span>，同时出现无油、频繁刹车答<span class=\"mark-wrong\">×</span></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"entry\">\n    <div class=\"heading\">\n      <span class=\"number\">60:</span>\n      <span class=\"title\">【急救伤员题】</span>\n    </div>\n    <ul class=\"care-list\">\n      <li>看到【中毒】<span class=\"keyword\">要搬高、转移</span>，原地等待不是救援，是<span class=\"keyword\">原地等死</span>。</li>\n      <li>【昏迷】首先要检查是否有呼吸脉搏</li>\n      <li>【骨折】不要移动，用<span class=\"keyword\">三角巾</span>固定 3-4 人平移硬担架</li>\n      <li>【失血】先<span class=\"keyword\">止血</span>，止血从绷头止，<span class=\"keyword\">近心端动脉</span></li>\n      <li>【全身烧伤】喷冷水灭火</li>\n      <li>【烧伤口渴】可喝<span class=\"keyword\">淡盐水</span>，只喝白开水 100 度答<span class=\"mark-wrong\">×</span></li>\n      <li>【烧伤起泡】用<span class=\"keyword\">保鲜膜</span>覆盖，避免感染</li>\n      <li>【包扎】不能用麻绳，错误选项，选麻绳</li>\n      <li>【昏迷伤】从搬运看<span class=\"keyword\">侧卧</span>，仰卧为恐惧误入气管，会有窒息危险</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"faint-stamp stamp-one\" aria-hidden=\"true\">[illegible]</div>\n  <div class=\"faint-stamp stamp-two\" aria-hidden=\"true\">[illegible]</div>\n  <div class=\"bottom-watermark\" aria-label=\"Unreadable bottom-right watermark\">[illegible]</div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
